## FROZEN-EX16-v1 cantilever design-domain mesh (Stage 1 and Stage 2 share this mesh)
## Domain: brick x in [0,2], y in [0,1], z in [0,1]; HEX8 mapped mesh, h = 1/24 (48 x 24 x 24)
reset
brick x 2.0 y 1.0 z 1.0
## Cubit centres the brick at the origin; translate so the corner is at the origin
move volume 1 x 1.0 y 0.5 z 0.5 include_merged
## Structured (mapped) hex mesh with exact interval counts
volume 1 scheme map
surface all scheme map
curve all interval 24
curve with length > 1.5 interval 48
mesh volume 1
## Single element block containing the whole domain
block 1 add volume 1
block 1 name "block_1"
block 1 element type HEX8
## Fixed face x = 0 (surface centroid at x = 0)
nodeset 1 add surface with x_coord < 0.001
nodeset 1 name "ns_fix"
## Loaded edge x = 2, y = 0, spanning z in [0,1] (curve centroid at (2, 0, 0.5))
nodeset 2 add curve with x_coord > 1.999 and y_coord < 0.001
nodeset 2 name "ns_load"
## Report counts into the journal log
list block 1
list nodeset 1
list nodeset 2
export mesh "mesh.exo" dimension 3 overwrite
